{"material_id":"mat_0d2041fef8b2","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"he5bxeygbly5kef64gvs1tk6m","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Kling 4.0 上线 Runware API，支持 30 秒 1080p 原生音频视频","excerpt":"Runware 宣布 Kling 4.0 发布首日上线其 API，可生成最长 30 秒的 1080p 视频，并支持原生音频。功能包括多关键帧（首、中、尾帧）、单请求最多 15 个输入（关键帧、参考图、参考视频与元素）以及基于提示词的已有片段编辑。价格自 $0.133 每秒起，未来 7 天常规定价享 15% 折扣；已有用户可将模型 ID 切换为 klingai:kling-video@4.0。Runware API 已有 19 个 Kling 模型，覆盖视频、图像、虚拟人和对口型。Kling AI 官方转发并提醒查看评论区中的创作者指南。","source_url":"https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2114574035468386746","canonical_url":"https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2114574035468386746","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:11.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:42.491Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_news","content_and_video"],"relevance_score":60,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":73,"fingerprint":"0d2041fef8b272e0be6df8850fba196257cef0c3d6f7ae697c4d4aaa2372e736","content_fingerprint":"1bf37bcca76eced3fc2205debfd5be54a9d092a6610cc84946a1bdcf313f2dcf"}
